  "description": "Mongoose was born from BMX racing with products that push the limits of what a rider can do on the track. Our latest line of BMX-style race bikes, the Title series, have been designed using that same race pedigree. Designed for beginner-level riders, the Mongoose Title Pro gives you a trophy-worthy bike at an amazingly affordable price!\nLightweight Tectonic T1 aluminum frame, integrated headset, and internal cable routing. 20.75” top tube length and frame weight of 3.11 lbs.\nDrivetrain features 170mm 3-piece tubular chromoly cranks with a 44T chainring and euro cartridge bottom bracket.\nArisun XLR8 20” x 1.95\"/1.75\" race tires mounted on Xposure® aluminum double wall rims with aluminum ball bearing front hub and 16T cog freewheel rear hub.\nHi-Ten steel handlebar and fork, 50mm stem, sealed bearing headset, and alloy V-brake and brake levers, Suggested rider height is 5'3\" - 5'8\".",
